  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc8:2.1.8": "“Delighting in solitude” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>suññāgāra</i>, literally, “delighting in an empty dwelling”. According to the commentaries, this is often an idiom for solitude. AN-a 1.88: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tattha ca rukkhamūlānīti iminā rukkhamūlasenāsanaṁ dasseti. Suññāgārānīti iminā janavivittaṭṭhānaṁ</i>; “And there <i lang='pi' translate='no'>rukkhamūlāni</i>: by this is shown dwellings at the foot of a tree; <i lang='pi' translate='no'>suññāgārāni</i>: by this (is shown) a place free from people.” ",
